# Note: rag_db/ and history.db are intentionally NOT ignored.
# The pre-populated ChromaDB and analysis database ship with the repository
# so that fresh clones and cold deploys work instantly — no 60-second
# warm-up on the first RAG query, and no empty dashboard on first load.